# Deny-by-default: ignore everything, then explicitly allow only
# the real project code/docs. This is intentional given this directory
# also holds caches, conda envs, model checkpoints, and .ssh — none of
# which should ever enter git history.
/*

# Allowed: project code and docs
!/scripts/
!/feature_attribution/
!/PROGRESS_fable_causal_features.md
!/PROMPT_fable_causal_features.md
!/MEMORY.md
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
